OL,3,AHundreds of thousands still without
OL,4,Apower after storms hit US on
OL,5,AThanksgiving
OL,6,
OL,7,FConditions are forecast now to improve,
OL,8,Fthough the National Weather Service
OL,9,F(NWS) cautions that it will take some
OL,10,Ftime. The West Coast has also been
OL,11,Faffected by its own storms.
OL,13,FFlight disruption also persists, with
OL,14,Fhundreds more delays and cancellations
OL,15,Freported on Friday - which is expected
OL,16,Fto be another busy travel day.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
